{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edgar wakes up in the mysterious Dream Library with no memory of who he is. To recover his lost memories he must travel through strange rooms and surreal dream worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter has ten golden books. When Edgar finds all the books the door to the next chapter opens. In the <strong>Reading Room</strong> he can read the books, which contain mysterious stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore dream worlds and collect golden books to unlock the next chapter. In <strong>Challenge Mode</strong> you can fly with a jet pack and complete speed runs to try to beat high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of \u201eEdgar Dreams and the Way of Light\u201c:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dream worlds and discover secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ten golden books in each chapter to move forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read mysterious stories in the Reading Room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode with jet pack speed runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy beautiful calm dream environments and relaxing music</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4117360?t=1765584044","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4117360?t=1765584044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117360/661333c878821876046eda2a127c0bafba5c46f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765584044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117360/661333c878821876046eda2a127c0bafba5c46f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765584044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edgar wakes 